“尊敬的客户，您好！已收到您关于订单【123456】的物流丢失反馈，工单编号【20240520123456】，我们将在1小时内联系物流公司核实，并同步您处理方案，感谢您的耐心等待！”\\n   - 中优先级回复示例：“尊敬的客户，您好！已收到您关于订单【123456】的换货申请，工单编号【20240520123456】，我们将在4小时内审核您的申请，审核通过后会发送换货地址，请注意查收！”\\n\\n**约束条件**：\\n- 回复中必须包含“工单编号”和“响应时限”，避免客户重复咨询；\\n- 若邮件未提供订单号，需在回复中引导客户补充（如“为更快处理您的问题，请回复本邮件提供对应的订单编号，感谢配合！”）；\\n- 涉及“退款金额”“赔偿诉求”的邮件，需在工单中特别标注“需财务部门协同”，并暂不承诺具体金额（回复中用“将根据平台规则与您协商解决方案”替代）。\"}, \"structOutputEnabled\": false}, \"type\": \"llm\", \"events\": {}, \"dragging\": false, \"isParent\": false, \"position\": {\"x\": 480, \"y\": 80}, \"resizing\": false, \"selected\": false, \"dimensions\": {\"width\": 300, \"height\": 163}, \"initialized\": false, \"handleBounds\": {\"source\": [{\"x\": 291.99997749711923, \"y\": 75.68747824991121, \"id\": null, \"type\": \"source\", \"width\": 12, \"height\": 12, \"nodeId\": \"llm_757616c9a\", \"position\": \"right\"}], \"target\": [{\"x\": -3.999985043703245, \"y\": 75.68747824991121, \"id\": null, \"type\": \"target\", \"width\": 12, \"height\": 12, \"nodeId\": \"llm_757616c9a\", \"position\": \"left\"}]}, \"computedPosition\": {\"x\": 480, \"y\": 80, \"z\": 0}}, {\"id\": \"end_765204hmo\", \"data\": {\"id\": \"end_765204hmo\", \"label\": \"结束\", \"output\": [{\"name\": \"content\", \"type\": \"\", \"label\": \"文本内容\", \"value\": \"\", \"nodeId\": \"1\", \"varType\": \"string\", \"variableSelector\": [\"1\", \"triggers\", \"content\"]}, {\"name\": \"query\", \"type\": \"\", \"label\": \"用户查询\", \"value\": \"\", \"nodeId\": \"1\", \"varType\": \"string\", \"variableSelector\": [\"1\", \"query\"]}, {\"name\": \"text\", \"type\": \"string\", \"label\": \"触发器输出\", \"value\": \"\", \"nodeId\": \"llm_757616c9a\", \"varType\": \"object\", \"description\": \"生成内容\", \"variableSelector\": [\"llm_757616c9a\", \"text\"]}], \"description\": \"工作流结束节点\"}, \"type\": \"end\", \"events\": {}, \"dragging\": false, \"isParent\": false, \"position\": {\"x\": 880, \"y\": 80}, \"resizing\": false, \"selected\": true, \"dimensions\": {\"width\": 300, \"height\": 157}, \"initialized\": false, \"handleBounds\": {\"source\": null, \"target\": [{\"x\": -3.999985043703245, \"y\": 72.2890754809955, \"id\": null, \"type\": \"target\", \"width\": 12, \"height\": 12, \"nodeId\": \"end_765204hmo\", \"position\": \"left\"}]}, \"computedPosition\": {\"x\": 880, \"y\": 80, \"z\": 1000}}], \"viewport\": {\"x\": -462.2952029520295, \"y\": 113.04126132170416, \"zoom\": 1.4424689701442468}}', '{}', '1449618464510685185', '2025-09-03 16:01:20.535869', '1449618464510685185', '2025-09-03 16:01:21', '[]', '[]', '', '', '0', 0, '{}', NULL);
